ll, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXTDICE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 566876798, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": null, "btnText": null, "expression": null, "diceProperties": [{"width": null, "images": [], "fileIds": [], "diceType": "TEXT", "isInfant": false, "fileNames": [], "inputArray": "24,35,64,39,41,29,94,82,56,49,57,72,83"}], "longTextFontSize": null}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "pRJjpXCZrldQuz6CsfgYD", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 569985688, "text": "If you're finding this tricky . . .", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 569982137, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 448, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p>If your child is finding it tricky to partition numbers, try using real objects.</p>\n<p>You can make tens and ones out of items in your house.</p>\n<p>For example spaghetti and pasta, or pens and lids.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "k-5C8qEfDQ78FqLHbzgrm", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 569982178, "text": null, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 448, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>What to do:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose an object to represent 10s - like spaghetti or pens.</li>\n<li>Choose an object to represent 1s - like pasta or pen lids.</li>\n<li>Practice counting the tens in tens.</li>\n<li>Practice counting the ones in ones.</li>\n<li>Try making different numbers out of the tens and ones.</li>\n<li>25 is two tens and 5 ones.</li>\n<li>Only move onto adding numbers once your child is confident partitioning.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "-3iFVoQgVgpNfHUpuSSZL", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 569982163, "text": "Different ways to make tens and ones - chocolate fingers and raisins, pens and lids, spaghetti and pasta pieces.", "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "mo